      "id": "carson-ferguson",
      "wikidata": "Q138028461",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Carson Ferguson (born March 22, 2000) is an American professional dirt track racing and stock car racing driver. He currently competes full-time in the Lucas Oil Late Model Dirt Series, driving the No. 93 Longhorn Chassis for Paylor Motorsports. He has previously competed in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series. He is the younger cousin of Dirt Super Late Model driver, Chris Ferguson.",
